# AI Brain Memory Protocol (.cursorrules)
# Applicable to Cursor, Windsurf, Copilot, and other IDE AI agents.

1. MANDATORY CONTEXT:
   Always inspect `ai_brain/brain_summary.md` before taking actions in this workspace.
   Adhere to all recorded architecture decisions and developer preferences.

2. MEMORY PERSISTENCE:
   When creating new modules, fixing bugs, or changing project state, run:
   python ai_brain/brain.py remember "<Title>" "<Details>" --category [decision|architecture|bugfix|preference|task] --model "Cursor/IDE"

3. WORKING STATE:
   Keep active working state synchronized:
   python ai_brain/brain.py update-state --task "<Task>" --model "Cursor/IDE"
